      "manifestNotes": "ADR-0014 §9 (issue 1809): besides TickMath the stage deploys VaultAdapterOps, GatewayWindows, GatewayAuth and GatewayWithdrawOps (forge's own CREATE2 library deployment; the vault and gateway stages compile with the same settings, so forge finds them deployed and links the same addresses) and the ExclusionLedgerFactory (CREATE2, read by the vault stage as EXCLUSION_LEDGER_FACTORY). Fields: tick_math, vault_adapter_ops, gateway_windows, gateway_auth, gateway_withdraw_ops, exclusion_ledger_factory. BasketSwapOps is deployed by the first basket stage, with the basket libraries.",
