  "vaultRuleDecisions": {
    "deployPaused": "issue 1710 and issue 1705 Q1 (a): all four vaults deploy paused and only the Safe, through the timelock, opens them in stage 13 (owner, core 1619: rmUSDC is not special).",
    "unpauseInStage13": "issue 1520 and issue 1710: stage 13 is one unpause row per vault, none skipped on 8453; the same row reopens a vault after a pause-all (issue 1667).",
    "seed": "owner decision D3 (2026-10-01): rmUSDC is seeded with 1 USDC to SEED_SHARE_RECEIVER; issue 1705 Q6 (a): no basket seed, the 18-decimal virtual share offset protects all four.",
    "eligibilitySource": "issue 475 (one registry-backed eligibility gate): the router stage makes rmUSDC eligible at 10000 bps, so the router has a leg from its first block; each basket joins in its own stage from ELIGIBLE_VAULTS through registry.migrateEligibility (issue 1520). Recorded difference, issue 1705 C3.",
    "emergencyLevers": "issue 1705 Q2 (a): the EMERGENCY_ROLE levers differ by vault family (RobotMoneyVault adapters, BasketVault assets) and are named here per vault for the mainnet test; narrowing them is decided before the final deployment. No lever freezes withdrawals.",
    "registryNameSource": "issue 1705 C9: the registry stage registers rmUSDC under the sheet's VAULT_NAME, each basket registers itself under its script constant VAULT_NAME. Recorded difference until one source is chosen."
  },
