  "proxyNotes": "ADR-0014 §1 (issue 1809): the nine contracts that run behind their own ERC1967Proxy, with the stage that deploys each, the manifest field of the proxy address and of its implementation, and the implementation's build artifact. Every proxy stage writes upgrade_authority, upgrade_mode and <field>_layout_id (ADR-0014 §8: the sha256 of the contract's committed storage-layout snapshot) next to them and reads UPGRADE_AUTHORITY (the authority stage's timelock) and UPGRADE_MODE (the sheet: upgradeable or frozen-at-deploy, no default). The list equals contracts/test/fixtures/storage-layout/proxied.txt.",
